---
import { Highlighter, MessageSquare, Square, Undo2 } from '@inkbar/icons'

import Icon from '../site/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="features">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2>What it does today.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Inkbar covers reading, review and redaction marking. Everything below works in
        every framework package and with no framework.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="cell">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6zM15 3v4h4"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>Viewing</h3>
        <p>
          Pages render on PDF.js with a selectable text layer. Fit to width or page, zoom
          from 50% to 400%, and scroll continuously or a page at a time. Only pages near
          the viewport are mounted.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <Icon icon={Highlighter} />
        <h3>Highlights</h3>
        <p>
          Select text and highlight it with a click or the Enter key. The mark follows the
          text lines it covers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <Icon icon={MessageSquare} />
        <h3>Note threads</h3>
        <p>Pin a note to the page, then reply, edit and delete in a thread beside it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <Icon icon={Square} />
        <h3>Redaction marks</h3>
        <p>
          Mark selected text, or drag a box over any area. A mark records what to remove.
          Removing it from the file comes with saving into the PDF.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3l2.5 5.5L20 9l-4 4 1 6-5-3-5 3 1-6-4-4 5.5-.5z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>Suggested redactions</h3>
        <p>
          Pass in matches from your own detector. Each one shows its reason and
          confidence, and nothing counts until someone accepts it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 4H6v16h2M16 4h2v16h-2M10 9h4M10 13h4"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>Annotations as data</h3>
        <p>
          Export and import JSON with a published schema. Underline, strikeout, ink,
          shapes and lines from imported data display too, and the PDF's own annotations
          show as locked.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <Icon icon={Undo2} />
        <h3>Undo and redo</h3>
        <p>
          History with grouped steps, whether Inkbar holds the annotations or your app
          does. Put the undo and redo buttons wherever your toolbar has room.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.6"></circle>
          <path d="M5 9h14M12 9v5M8 21l4-7 4 7"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>Keyboard and screen readers</h3>
        <p>
          Highlight, add notes, and move, resize or delete marks from the keyboard, with
          labelled controls throughout. Drawing an area mark still needs a pointer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="next">
      <h3>On the way</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Search across the document</li>
        <li>Drawing tools for ink, shapes, lines and text boxes</li>
        <li>Filling form fields</li>
        <li>Saving annotations and applied redactions into the PDF</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 8vw, 112px);
  }
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--sheet);
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
  }
  .next {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px 32px;
  }
  .next ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .next li {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--caption);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--body);
  }
</style>
